<title>USA: Coastal Physician panel to review options.</title>
<headline>Coastal Physician panel to review options.</headline>
<dateline>DURHAM, N.C. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coastal Physician Group Inc said Thursday it has formed a committee of independent non-management directors to find ways to increase shareholder value, and may consider selling the entire company.</p>
<p>Shareholders had approved a non-binding resolution at the company's annual meeting in September, asking that such a panel be created.</p>
<p>&quot;The new shareholder value committee recognizes the importance of evaluating all possible alternatives to enhance Coastal's value for our shareholders, including a sale of the entire company,&quot; Chairman Jacque Sokolov said in a statement.</p>
</text>
